    "q-316812": {
      "dom_id": "step-q316812",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14251078/assets/08ac5be11bc156cf1e43fc7d5e6283b4c4514c78d3280180f8d66eca8c66eab6.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $a$ is perpendicular to $b$, $|a|=4$ and $|b|=7.$ Find the **exact** value of $|a+b|.$\n\n$|a+b|=$\n {{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that we have a right triangle. So, we can use Pythagorean theorem as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{|a+b|}^{2} & ={|a|}^{2}+{|b|}^{2} \\\\  & ={4}^{2}+{7}^{2} \\\\  & =65\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, $|a+b|=\\sqrt{65}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
